window.products.push({"id":810071,"name":"Humidifiers for Bedroom, Large Room, AMEIFU Top Fill Humidifier, 4.5L Quiet Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifiers for Home, Baby, Nursery, Up to 40 Hours R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z9TrDgpuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【UPGRADE TOP FILL HUMIDIFIERS -NO LEAKAGE】 Our AMEIFU humidifier is designed with a top fill, easy to refill and less messy. There’ s no more removing the tank, flipping it over, filling it, flipping it over again and reinserting. No need to disassemble the mini humidifier, just refill the tank of the cool mist humidifiers from the top, avoid the water leakage from the bottom and wetting the table. The front transparent water gauge makes the room humidifier noticeable to see the water level. 【ENJOY COMFORTABLE AIR HUMIDITY】 The humidifiers for home provide fast, comfortable relief from the dry air. The air humidifiers diffuse moisture into the air, make you breathe easier and get restful sleep, moisturize your skin and alleviate the discomfort in allergy season, also help you get rid of the sinus issues. The 4.5L humidifier make it fill less often than other humidifiers, and the small humidifier humidifies up to 322ft² rooms, perfect for baby, nursery, plants, and pets. 【SUPER QUIET & AUTO POWER Off】Our super quiet ultrasonic humidifiers operate at low than 35DB, almost silent, which offers maximum relaxation during sleeping or working. The humidifiers for bedroom large room features an automatic shut-off safety function that will turn off when it runs out of water, preventing damage to the unit and ensure your safety, also making desk humidifier a great choice for your bedroom or as a baby humidifier. 【EASY TO CLEAN】 The humidifier for plants is easy to clean thanks to the wide top opening: 7.09in. Just open the tap cover and take out the spray chamber, you can easily put your hands scrubbed into all corners in the empty water tank with a damp cloth to clean, adding some white vinegar is helpful. Please do not upside down the spray chamber to avoid the water pouring into it. Warm tips: We recommend you clean the house humidifier once a week prevents buildups and extend the working lifetime. 【3 MIST LEVELS & Optional Nightlight】Three adjustable mist levels, which allows you get appropriate mist according to your need. (The intermittent mist level working 20s then stop 10s. ) The big bonus function is that the humidifier for home also bring a unique and charming blue lights, just power on the humidifier to enjoy a soothing night light, and you can also turn off the light if you are sensitive to the light source while sleeping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z9TrDgpuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMEIFU","source_asin":"B09YRT6QTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YRT6QTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YRT6QTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
