window.products.push({"id":810140,"name":"Mess Pros Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set with LED Light - Upgraded Salt and Pepper Grinders - Refillable Sleek Design - Powerful, but Quieter Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817QS6A6pYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you ever been using a manual spice grinder and had it jam or get clogged? Wouldn’t it be great if you could press a button and get the perfect size and amount of salt, pepper, or other spices you are freshly grinding? If either of those questions have you nodding your head in agreement, then you’re going to love these battery-operated salt and pepper grinders! Growing up, I can remember enjoying big family meals together. There was no TV or phones, and we rarely ordered takeout. My mother insisted that we all pitch in and help prepare dinner in some way. Sometimes it was setting the table, doing the dishes, or even helping her prep food. Looking back, those meals were some of the most memorable moments of my childhood. I tried to keep the tradition going with my family, but it’s been a challenge. Between prepared meals at the grocery stores, meal delivery apps, and tons of delicious restaurants, we were rarely cooking and eating dinner together. The idea behind Mess Pros was to create innovative products that solved problems in the kitchen and help bring families back together. It may sound strange, but the products we develop, including this electric salt and pepper grinder set, got my wife and me to start cooking a lot more! The kids got totally into it too. They loved fidgeting with the new gadgets and pitching in. My hope is that this salt pepper grinder set not only lightens your load in the kitchen by replacing an outdated set but also inspires you to cook more. I can’t promise you’ll be having nightly family dinners as I did as a kid, but I can promise that these will be the best salt and pepper grinders that you’ll ever own! Give them a try for 30 days, and if you don’t agree, let me know, and I’ll give you a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817QS6A6pYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mess Pros","source_asin":"B0783N27TL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0783N27TL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0783N27TL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
