window.products.push({"id":810201,"name":"Rachael Ray Hard Anodized Nonstick 15-Inch Oval Grill Pan, Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31FzwIlPAvL._AC_.jpg","description":"During the frosty months of winter, grill hamburgers and steak at the stovetop in this 15-inch oval grill pan. From Rachael Ray’s hard-anodized line of cookware, the elongated grill pan’s grooved cooking surface replicates the coveted stripes of an outdoor grill on bratwurst and tofu dogs. The grooves also facilitate effortless burger flipping while the meat’s run-off juices collect in between the raised ridges. The oval pan’s hard-anodized aluminum construction distributes even heat while deflecting dents, corrosion, and general wear and tear. The nonstick coating on the pan’s interior enables greater ease while cooking and cleaning. To steady the pan while cooking or to remove it from the burner, a handle is securely riveted to the cookware’s side. An orange silicone rubber sleeve on the handle provides a comfortable grip while the sleeve also can sustains temperatures up to 400 degrees F in the oven. For enhanced storage options, the handle end offers a pre-installed hanging hole. Wash the pan by hand while avoiding abrasive pads and cleansers to preserve the nonstick treatment. A limited lifetime warranty covers this item. Made in China, the grill pan measures 18 by 15-1/3 by 4-3/5 inches and weighs 2-4/5 pounds upon shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31FzwIlPAvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rachael Ray","source_asin":"B000HTY5DW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HTY5DW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HTY5DW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
