window.products.push({"id":810314,"name":"Inked and Screened Aviation Cutaways Lockheed Martin F-22A Raptor Design Art Poster Silk Screen Print, 18\" L x 24\" H, Chalkboard, White Ink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716LQg8T9fL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Inked & Screened posters are hand printed to order making each run a very limited edition. We're excited to offer high quality prints using non-toxic acrylic ink on top thick high quality 100 lb. paper (6 prints weight over 1 pound!). Screen printed products can be identified by their thick raised ink and in some cases and impression of the mesh screen. Where digital and offset prints represent white by the lack of ink on an image, screen prints utilize a white ink to provide an incredibly vivid brilliant color unachievable by other forms of printing. This allows screen prints to stand out from traditionally printed posters and shine in a different light. Through limited runs, thick durable posters, brilliant colors and thick raised ink all done by hand by those that love this art form, each screen is printed uniquely for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716LQg8T9fL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inked and Screened","source_asin":"B01M8JTVEP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M8JTVEP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M8JTVEP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":810315,"name":"uxcell Kitchen Tongs for Cooking with Silicone Round Tip Stainless Steel Tongs Toaster Salad Serving BBQ Non-stick Locking Tong 9\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-AKfzqNYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WITH DURABLE MATERIAL: The kitchen tong are made from a thick 1mm 430 stainless steel, sturdy, anti-rust, anti-corrosion. Paired with non-stick, heat-resistant silicone tips won't scrape your expensive cookware or grill. The heat resistant up to 450°F. It is great to use for your home cooking, holiday cooking, barbecues, and of course for restaurants other commercial use. They’ll be your favorite kitchen tools. STRONG PULL RING LOCKING MECHANISM: This kitchen tongs with locking mechanism and durable spring mechanism. Pull the ring for lock and push for open, very easy to operation. Practical looped ends make them easy to hang in your kitchen so you can keep them readily accessible. ENGINEERING FOR SAFE HANDLE: Our handle is well polished, smooth and easy to hold, better protects your hands from cutting by the edge when you grip the handle. The silicone part are useful when gripping heavy objects. It's good for thumb rest, ensures tongs has good grip and control. Those silicone tongs help you reliable pick of hot foods from your grill or cookware while protecting your hands from hot cooking temperatures. HEALTHY AND EASY TO CLEAN: Those tongs has reliable pick of hot foods. Rounded head great for scooping and holding foods, perforated part for straining excess water and oils from foods. Food will not stick to the tong so that you can use a quick wipe and rinse it with hot water or just throw them in the dishwasher. MULTIPLE APPLICATIONS: Individual cooking tong 9\" and 12\" size tongs are practical tools for handling most of food types. It's perfect for basic kitchen tasks, whatever it used indoors or outdoors. The 12\" tong perfect for grilling to keep your hands away from the grill. The 9\" tongs provide superior gripping power for pick hefty turkey, steaks, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-AKfzqNYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uxcell","source_asin":"B08NVPZ354","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NVPZ354","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NVPZ354","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
