window.products.push({"id":810329,"name":"Oversized White Dark Gray Kitchen Towels: 100% Cotton Soft Absorbent Assortment Ribbed Terry Loop, Set of 3 Multipurpose for Everyday Use (Charcoal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dNAVLPRSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Oversized kitchen dish towels. A variety of solid colors. Ideal for your kitchen, this towel will give you the most comfortable feel and soft touch base when used. You can even send this towel as a gift to your friend or to your eldest one while sending them off to college. This towel brings an easy convenience to your daily routine. Whether hung together in the kitchen or neatly folded and stacked in the cabinet, you can never go wrong with this. Always wash new towels before use. Excess dye, chemicals, etc., can still reside in factory produce towels. You may also use fabric softener on towels. To ensure the long life of towels, wash them on a very gentle cycle in cold water before drying them on low setting in a dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dNAVLPRSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serafina Home","source_asin":"B0B59THTL2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B59THTL2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B59THTL2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":810330,"name":"Cooling Side Sleeper Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain, Luxury Shredded Memory FoamBed pillows for sleeping - Adjustable Queen Size Curved Pillow Neck","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gtzE0UUwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌙[BEST PAIN RELIEF MEMORY FOAM PILLOWS for side sleeprs] Created with all sleepers especially side sleepers in mind, The Kucey pillow designs a special shape that allows the filling to provide support to the very edges, keeping your head in the centre. Kucey curved pillow enjoys unique patent angle and curve which can EFFECTIVLY CUTTING DOWN PAIN of YOUR HEAD, NECK AND SHOULDERs and other commonly experienced issues. 🌙[PEREMIUM CLOUD COMFORT BAMBOO PILLOW for sleeping] Different with ordinary pillow cover, Kucey bamboo pillow cover has two different sides. One of them is made of premium bamboo material, which enables your pillow to be ultra soft and comfortable.Gently cushioning memory foam contours and moulds to your head for incredible comfort and complete neck support. Feel gently cradled like a cloud and fall asleep the moment your head hits the pillow. Well improving your sleeping quality. 🌙[PERFECT COOLING BED PILLOWS for HOT SLEEPERS] Are you a hot sleeper? You get great chance now. Our Cooling technology can draw heat away from your body while you will feel cool on your skin. With cooling fiber on the other side of the pillow case, Kucey cooling side sleeper pillow can help you sleep a few degrees cooler. So it keeps your body temperature regulated throughout the night. Well Please kindly note that the cooling effect depends on your go-to sleeping position, any allergies you may have, and how much temperature regulation you need. 🌙[LUXURY PILLOW with ROMANTIC STARS and MOON PATTERN] Details make perfect. As soon as receiving our luxury memory foam pillows, you will immediately get the outstanding quality of Kucey brand. Instead of other thin fllat no character pillows, it has patent 3D zone interlayer design and enjoys most romantic pattern. The luxury stars and moons pattern can immediately improve your room decoration level and give you a happy mood everyday. Imagine how sweet and romantic it is to hug stars and moons on your arms every night. 🌙[NEVER BE FLAT shredded memory foam pillow for stomach sleepers] Well, what inside is really counts when we’re talking pillows, especially the ones designed to keep you best support. Compared with traditional Memory foam, Kucey Shredded memory foam is a popular pillow fill to help balance the heat transfer. Additionally, Kucey premium shredded memory foam can be more breathable, which allowing your body heat to dissipate and air to flow freely. And they will perfectly support your head and neck and they will never be flat. Every one needs a healthy and no flat pillow for better sleeping. 🌙[ADJUSTABLE HEIGHT pillow with extra additional loft] If adjustability is your game, you’ll be excited to discover that this pillow allows sleepers in every other position to find appropriate loft helps maintain a healthy spinal alignment. Since the pillow is made with shredded memory foam filling, you can add or remove foam from the inner pillow to adjust it to your preferred height—it even comes with a bag of additional filling if you prefer an extra-firm pillow. 🌙[FIRMNESS CUSTOMIZE BY YOURSELF] If you switch between your back and side throughout the night, this pillow can also allows you to customize your firmness and softness to what's most comfortable for you. 🌙[EXCLUSIVE SUPPORTIVE PILLOWS for ALL sleeprs] This pillow is designed to be equally comfortable and supportive whether you sleep on your back, side or on your stomach.It was reversible and supportive not just on their side, but back and stomach too – ideal for a more restless sleeper. 🌙[YOUR BEST CONTOUR PILLOW EVER] Our best-selling curve pillow is great for people seeking additional neck support with its curved ergonomic shape, or have enjoyed contoured pillows in the past. Height adjustable. 🌙[VERY EASY CARE]Our thoughtfully designed pillow cover is removable and washable so you can get it cleaned as often as you like. EASY CARE.Softness and support, sustainability, adjustability, washability, hygienic and cooling features, OUR PILLOWS HAVE CONSIDERED ALL YOUR NEEDS AND WILL BE YOUR BEST PILLOWS EVER.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gtzE0UUwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUCEY","source_asin":"B0BD4HQS29","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD4HQS29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD4HQS29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
