window.products.push({"id":810384,"name":"Glass Teapot No Drip Special Lead Free Glass (34 oz Pink Love)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qr8tHrH4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This item includes one teapot ONLY. Designed by Jane London, Love teapot 34 oz, is inspired by a truly remarkable story of Jazz Jennings who is named one of Time Magazine’s 25 most influential Teens of 2014. I was watching the interview by Katie Couric, The New Face of Transgender Youth, and immediately I fell in love with Jazz’s story. Jennings was born as a boy but has a girl’s brain, as wrote in her co-authored book, “I am Jazz”. She received lots of love from her family and friends. She also gives love to people who are like her by increasing awareness of Transgender and encouraging others who don’t fit in to live a fulfilled life. There are two hearts on the teapot body. The smaller heart represents individual’s love. The bigger heart represents love from our society. I hope this teapot reminds everyone that we should not only love ourselves, but also love our families, gay, lesbian, transgender, strangers, communities, and people worldwide. There are no boundaries in the world of love. Teapot handle has anti-slip feature which is easy to grab. The lid comes with a beautiful heart as well, which represents love and a healthy life. Special feature non-drip at the spout makes tea drinking a hassle free experience. The spacious strainer allows tea leaves to fully unfold and steep. Easy to clean. It’s made of special LEAD-FREE glass that can handle temperature shock. Hand clean. Love is love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qr8tHrH4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tea Beyond","source_asin":"B00Z5JAU4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Z5JAU4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Z5JAU4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
