window.products.push({"id":810472,"name":"Electric Can Opener, Safety Can Opener Smooth Edge, Battery Operated, No Sharp Edge, Open Cans with A Button, Food-Safe, Mini Can Opener Electric Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510sjoIBoiS._AC_SL1154_.jpg","description":"Electric can opener One key to start and stop at any time, the electric can opener automatically opens your cans within 30 seconds. Small but powerful, it can open any size lid whether small, medium or large and it is cut from the side so that it doesn't leave sharp edges. Features: Powerful function, suitable for most sizes of cans, electric can opener is easy to use Open can in 30 seconds, powered by 2 x AA batteries. (Not included) Suitable for human hands, compact size and one hand can be used for easy storage No more sharp edges, no more sharp edges and wrist problems, kids can use it safely. Operation: Step 1: Place the can opener on the can, with its edge in the groove between the cutter and the drive wheel. Step 2: Place the can on a flat surface, press and hold the button for about 2 seconds and release The can opener starts cutting the sides of the can. Step 3: After the cut is complete, the can opener will stop automatically and then remove the can opener from the can. Step 4: When the lid of the can is stuck, immediately press the button on the end of the can opener to reverse the cutter. The cutter rotates in the opposite direction and the lid falls off. Troubleshooting 1. When the battery is exhausted, pressing the button may not release the glass. Slide back the battery cover and replace the 2 AA batteries. The can opener should be cut further. Remember to replace the battery 2. Jars with heavy stitching and uneven edges may stop the can opener. Immediately press the button at the end of the can opener to reverse the cutter. The cutter rotates in the opposite direction, and then you can remove the can opener and restart it 3. When the can is stuck, press the button at the end of the can opener to reverse the cutter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510sjoIBoiS._AC_SL1154_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOLTSE","source_asin":"B09MVLT6VS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MVLT6VS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MVLT6VS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
