window.products.push({"id":810545,"name":"GOSCIEN Food Vacuum Sealer, Mini USB Portable Rechargeable Vacuum Sealer Machine Food Vacuum Sealer with 10 Reusable Zipper Bags Handheld Cordless 60K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718EHXz-cbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ღ【Keep food fresh for frozen storage in refrigerator】 Wireless handheld portable sealer can help preserve most dry and moist foods, widely used for meats, seafoods, vegetables, fruits, cereals and nut snacks. Please properly maximize your sealer by instructions and you need to classify of wet and dry food materials. When wet materials, please do not suck liquids directly. When a liquid enters the suction nozzle, stop working immediately ღ【Eco-friendly and compact】 It can save your food,space and money.Portable size and it is with type-C fast charging, so do not need to waste extra money on batteries. Unit comes with a rechargeable cable so that you can use it more times. It removes excess air from bags quickly, and pack it as small and tight as possible. When the vacuum done, the wet materials can be placed in the fridge freezing compartment for cryopreservation ღ【Reusable zipper food storage bags with air valve】 Handheld sealer come with 10 zipper seal bags, reusable and BPA free, recycle and safe to store food and slow down foods decay. Each bag has a label for writing down name of food storing and expiry dates for conveniently categorized. Zipper sealer bags should be replaced once you check air valve is broken to avoid food decay because as store sharp objects ღ【One-button operation and low noisy】 Just only touch the button switch lightly , the light will turn on, after just place the bag and flat on the desktop, put your food into reusable bag, seal it by using clips, and after the vacuum is automatically completed, then the light will gone out. 【Note】Align the sealer with the blue air valve for exhaust, and to press down very hard so that there is no gap between the nozzle and the valve before it will begin to suck the air out of the bag ღ【Multipurpose】 Portable sealer machine not only keep foods fresh, such as fruits, vegetable, fish, freshness of meat, beans, seafood, grains, cheese and nuts. It also stores for your vacuum jars","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718EHXz-cbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOSCIEN","source_asin":"B0921QM75V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0921QM75V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0921QM75V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
