window.products.push({"id":810606,"name":"BLEUM CADE Rotary Cheese Grater, 3 in 1 Drum Blades Grater Slicer Shredder Cheese Grater Rotary with Handle Food Shredder with Strong Suction Base Rot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MpvG5YjNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧀 Premium Material: The rotary cheese grater blade is made of stainless steel, and the other parts of the grater are made of BPA-free food-grade ABS plastic. Our rotary cheese grater comes with a durable and sturdy handle. Also, this cheese grater with handle is a perfect Christmas gift for your families, friends and cooking lovers you know. It is convenient to use this grater on any occasion. 🧀 Safe Rotary Cheese Grater: The high quality materials and one-piece body design make sure this grater more durable and stable. Compared to conventional slicers, the protective design prevents touching the blade without the worry of cutting your fingers. You can enjoy the process of preparing your dishes with confidence. The grater base needs to be fixed on a smooth and clean counter. 🧀 Strong Suction Base And Easy To Assemble: Turn the knob and the cheese grater sucks on the counter. The upgraded strong suction silicone base makes the grater more stable and efficient in use. It is very easy to assemble and disassemble the food grater and put the grater back in the box when you are done using it. The detachable design also reduces the burden on your kitchen cabinets. 🧀 3 in 1 Multi-functional Food Shredder: The upgraded 3 interchangeable blades are very sharp, cut at high speed and effortlessly to meet your different cutting needs: julienne, slice and grind. which are also perfect for cheese, cucumber, potato, radish, zucchini, chocolate, garlic and even peanuts, and almonds. This will help make many holiday dishes with ease! 🧀 Easy To Use and Clean: This rotary grater for kitchen slicing tools makes it easy to cut cheese and vegetables. Place cheese and vegetables into the grater and turn the handle to slice, grate or shred. Get freshly grated cheese or shredded vegetables in seconds. Simply rinse the drum with running water in the sink when clean it. You can put stainless steel grating drums in the top rack of your dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MpvG5YjNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLEUM CADE","source_asin":"B0BM5N77X1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM5N77X1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM5N77X1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
