window.products.push({"id":810686,"name":"Suripow Single Serve Coffee Tea Maker Brewers for K-Cup Pod &Ground Powder,Brew Strength Control with Compact Design, 8 to 14 Oz, Thermal Drip Instant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wI8TueJTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☀FAST & FRESH BREWED: Suripow single serve coffee tea maker made from fast brewing technology. In lucky peach magazine, many food bloggers recommend that 195.8°F water is the most suitable temperature to induce coffee aroma and keep fresh. Suripow fast brewing technology based on this theory. Quickly have your delicious coffee within 3 minutes! The water adjustment function(6, 8, 10, 14 ounces) offers you brewing strength control,to achieve the best taste for you. ☀2 In 1 Brewing Methods,4 Capacity Choices:Whether you like K-cup pods or traditional ground coffee powder or tea bags, this single cup coffee machine is customized specifically for you, coming with two buttons on the right side let you switch freely between K-cup pods or ground coffee powder . So easy to make coffee! ☀Self-Cleaning Button &Auto-Off Function: Make your coffee brewing process easier, after brewing your coffee, add 6 ounces of water and catch it with the same size cup while simply pressing the double button on the right side and the coffee maker will start cleaning itself, forgot to turn it off? Don't worry, it'll will automatically shut itself off after brewing a cup of coffee,helping to save energy. ☀Compact And Durable Design:Less than 5.4” wide, fits neatly on your countertop, perfect for RV travel, office desk, hotel, small house kitchen counter. Innovatively designed to be compact and durable, extremely effective, this coffee maker is much smaller than others, no worrying your space, just put it on the area as big as the palm of the hand. ☀Notes:.Please brew water to clean for first use,it can be more effective to extract essence from coffee.ONLY can be used under USA voltage standard 110V-120V, a voltage converter is needed if used in other countries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wI8TueJTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Suripow","source_asin":"B08JLWQ4MG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JLWQ4MG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JLWQ4MG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
