window.products.push({"id":810822,"name":"Reliable IronMaven J420 Home Ironing System, Made in Europe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5183HcZSULL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"What's the secret to getting a clean, crisp finish to your garments? Professionals know the value of using dry, pressurized steam when ironing. This gets the steam into the fabric faster--your ironing time is cut in half (it's true). Steam is used to soften the fibers, and the weight of the iron shapes the fabric. This is done effortlessly when you have the right tools to do the job. Pressurized steam is the key. Once you've used it, you will never go back to you old iron again. Find out what garment makers, dry cleaners and tailors have known for years; using pressurized steam transforms ironing from a tiresome chore to an effortless task. Now the same quality steam is available to everyone. The Reliable IronMaven J420 uses a large (5-cup) 18/10 stainless steel tank to contain the water. Heat up time takes only 7-8 minutes. When the water level is low, a light indicator lets you know it is time to refill the tank. Reliable understands that the quality of an ironing system is only as good (no matter how nice it looks) as what is inside it. This is why we use the best components available to ensure your total satisfaction. Lifetime product warranty policy applies to all Reliable Corporation pressurized steam boiler tanks. See warranty document for details.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5183HcZSULL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reliable","source_asin":"B0028QHMHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0028QHMHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0028QHMHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
