window.products.push({"id":810855,"name":"BSICPRO Bathroom Rugs Non Slip, Bath Mats Rugs for Bathroom, Extra Thick Soft Absorbent Chenille Shaggy Bathroom Floor Mats, Machine Washable (20\" x 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PCvt4V61L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【SUPER SOFT & THICK BATHROOM RUGS】: BSICPRO gray bath mat set is made of premium soft, dense & thick chenille microfiber polyester, which provide you with a comfortable softness and give your feet an exceptional comfort and relax. 【HIGH WATER ABSORBENCY BATH MAT】: The absorbent chenille microfibers can quickly absorb moisture from your feet when you step out of the bath or shower, save your floors from dripping water, and dries quickly, provide you a clean bathroom. 【ANTI SKID BREATHABLE BACKING】: Compared with other plastic TPR OR PVC backing, we use innovative material SBE/Hot melt spray backing, durable and natural, which can helps the bath mats airy and fresh and make you bathroom floor drying and cleaning. Attention: The bath rug underlay should be clean, flat, and dry before placing the mat on the floor. Water or dust under mat may cause slippage. 【UNIQUE MODERN DESIGN BATHROOM MATS】: Unique modern stripe design provides a fashionable accent to any area within home (bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, living room, door entrances), bring charming and fantastic feeling for your family, this thick bath rugs can be used as a bath mat, shower mat, kitchen rug, toilet mat, floor mat, door mat, bathtub rug, or pet rug etc. 【MACHINE WASHABLE BATH RUGS】: Durable material, machine washable, With premium fiber locking technology, every fiber is firmly attached onto the backing so that the bathroom mat will not shed during using or washing, color will stay nice and vibrant for years to come no matter how many times be washed and dried. Machine wash with cold water and mild detergent (no chlorine or bleach) tumble dry at low speed or hang dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PCvt4V61L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BSICPRO","source_asin":"B09GB72C6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-810855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GB72C6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GB72C6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
